<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Painkiller</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sick Joy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Painkiller</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6MtTo58EZbRou7FYinWMvl</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Painkiller Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been listening to dreams, and</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been talking to ghosts</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been listening to numbers in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't mean nothing at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been breathing in monochrome</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I only get what I got</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been calling out to God, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She's not sayin' a lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I keep running to alleviation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The bad habits that keep me breathin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They turn me down and turn me off</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sayin', 'Shut up, shut up'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Painkiller</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Painkiller</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller (painkiller)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's hard gettin' enough of it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When it almost works</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Deep down, or up above, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Enough is never enough[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I keep running to alleviation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The bad habits that keep me breathin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They turn me down and turn me off</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sayin', 'Shut up, shut up'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Painkiller</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Painkillеr</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller (painkiller)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thе way I walk, what I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is anything really fucking me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I never had or needed any of my</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Painkiller</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller (painkiller)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller (painkiller)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish I didn't need you, painkiller (painkiller)</p></div></body></tt>